{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Diceville</strong>, a city-building strategy game where every roll of the dice can change your destiny!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by board games, Diceville combines the depth of card-based tactics with the unpredictability of dice rolls \u2014 all without the hassle of managing tokens, rules, or math.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build unique structures from your deck and activate them based on dice results. Some buildings earn you resources, others benefit your rivals, and some offer powerful, game-changing effects.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the game progresses, upgrade your central HQ to unlock new abilities and paths to victory. The first player to fully upgrade their HQ wins \u2014 but getting there means smart planning, timing, and a bit of luck.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play solo, with friends, or challenge AI in a fast-paced digital take on a tabletop classic!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features:</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dice-driven mechanics</strong> with deep card-based strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand</strong> your city with unique structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based gameplay</strong> \u2014 plan every move carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your HQ</strong> to unlock powerful new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer on a single device</strong> (2\u20134 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI opponents</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages</strong>: English and Russian (more to come!)</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3924630?t=1759954354","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924630/e554c9aada93685f38e45cdafb19512b5f01caf2/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1