>Dice-driven mechanics</strong> with deep card-based strategy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build and expand</strong> your city with unique structures</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Turn-based gameplay</strong> \u2014 plan every move carefully</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Upgrade your HQ</strong> to unlock powerful new abilities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Multiplayer on a single device</strong> (2\u20134 players)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>AI opponents</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Languages</strong>: English and Russian (more to come!)</p></li></ul>","developers":["PointOfView"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Massively Multiplayer","id":"29"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3924630/e07379782a43a1234756957ee9b80ff07a1584f9/header.jpg?t=1759954354","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924630/43341155/f096bb9f5fbee782854d1ca41dd55714c121399a/1756241963/dash_av1.mpd?t=1756243419","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924630/43341155/f096bb9f5fbee782854d1ca41dd55714c121399a/1756241963/dash_h264.mpd?t=1756243419","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3924630/43341155/f096bb9f5fbee782854d1ca41dd55714c121399a/1756241963/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1756243419","id":257179251,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257179251/movie480.mp4?t=1756243